325625909929158", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982457_325625913262491_8659356926128038723_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ODXprQhmWOkQ7kNvwFxPnCa&_nc_oc=Adrobte6lbZSN4W4zOQNdcXCklz-GHG7PBUm1uAF9pqgM9Qs0yMkfXWRkcFQqg08I5A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTksYBYvqa6kMrVkobqWtMsPPdedrXe6hPHlmnKG_Rggw&oe=6AFDDD5C"}, "display_name": "Fantasia Canvas", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Fantasia Canvas invites you to seamlessly transition from the bustling demands of daily life into an atmosphere of tranquility and relaxation.\n\nColoring vivid miniatures is a truly mesmerizing and engaging experience, complemented by a perfect harmony of effects, sounds, and surroundings designed to alleviate the stresses of a hectic day.\n\nThe game doesn't require any physical or in-game movement from you. You can play it comfortably both while standing and sitting. And the entire gameplay is exceptionally smooth, enveloping you in a meditative atmosphere.\n\nOur team is preparing numerous new exciting episodes for you to enjoy soon.\n\nEmbark on this engaging adventure and experience the meditative power of VR with a painting journey.", "short_description": "Fantasia Canvas invites you to seamlessly transition from the bustling demands of daily life into an atmosphere of tranquility and relaxation.\n\nColoring vivid miniatures is a truly mesmerizing and engaging experience, complemented by a perfect harmony of effects, sounds, and surroundings designed to alleviate the stresses of a hectic day.\n\nEmbark on this engaging adventure and experience the meditative power of VR with a painting journey."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fantasia.games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fantasia Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fantasia.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating"